From 966137c3c13504785f9942cd2ecc77b435b86134 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 22:13:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 603/603] feat(desktop): remote project groups from the hub
 replica; rename/theme another gateway's project as a shared field [daveey]

A remote gateway the Desktop can't reach (asleep) or hasn't reached yet this run is drawn from the
hub replica (hub-sync GET /projects, hermes-hub >= 1.9.0), so its project groups never vanish. Its
declared projects (remoteProject) get Rename and Appearance: each field is a hub shared-field set on
every declared project the group stands for, applied by the owner when it is next awake; the cached
remote tree takes the change so repaints keep it, and a refused set rolls back.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
